# Loaded only during cutover, in this order. cloudflare-tunnel must stay last.
vault-failover|scripts/k3d-manager vault_install_failover_watchdog|Hub Vault failover watcher
ssh-tunnel-vault|tunnel_start|Hostinger reverse Vault tunnel; needs HOSTINGER_HOST
ssh-tunnel|tunnel_start|Hostinger k3s API tunnel; needs HOSTINGER_HOST
cleanup|install-cleanup|Shared state cleanup
node-health-watch|install-node-health-watch|Node health reporting
sandbox-reaper|install-sandbox-reaper|Shared sandbox cleanup
acg-watch|scripts/k3d-manager acg_watch_start|ACG sandbox watcher
prometheus-credential-rotator|install-prometheus-credential-rotator|Prometheus credential rotation
hub-snapshot|make snapshot-schedule|Hub data snapshot
hub-data-export|make hub-data-export-schedule|Hub data export
test-metrics|install-test-metrics|Nightly test metrics
cloud-bridge|install-cloud-bridge|External cloud request bridge
webhook|bin/k3dm-webhook-setup|External webhook
hermes|bin/k3dm-hermes-setup|External notifications and automation
cloudflare-tunnel|_ensure_cloudflare_tunnel_agent|Public ingress; install last
